  <text id="title" x="86" y="52" width="760" height="46" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">Economic value unlocked</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="86" y="102" width="1060" height="48" font="body" size="20" color="muted" line-height="1.3"><p>This platform matters because administrative efficiency becomes economic value when it affects housing supply, extractive investment, public revenue, and trust in formal transactions.</p></text>

  <shape id="callout-1" type="rect" x="86" y="176" width="338" height="144" fill="surface" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="callout-1-number" x="110" y="200" width="220" height="42" font="display" size="34" color="primary" wrap="false">Faster approvals</text>
  <text id="callout-1-body" x="110" y="250" width="286" height="48" font="body" size="17" color="muted" line-height="1.35"><p>Shorter waits help housing, infrastructure, and investment projects move faster from application to execution.</p></text>

  <shape id="callout-2" type="rect" x="471" y="176" width="338" height="144" fill="surface" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="callout-2-number" x="495" y="200" width="220" height="42" font="display" size="34" color="accent" wrap="false">Stronger trust</text>
  <text id="callout-2-body" x="495" y="250" width="286" height="48" font="body" size="17" color="muted" line-height="1.35"><p>Verification, custody history, and secure evidence handling make transactions safer for regulators and investors.</p></text>

  <shape id="callout-3" type="rect" x="856" y="176" width="338" height="144" fill="surface" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="callout-3-number" x="880" y="200" width="220" height="42" font="display" size="34" color="#B45309" wrap="false">Better revenue</text>
  <text id="callout-3-body" x="880" y="250" width="286" height="48" font="body" size="17" color="muted" line-height="1.35"><p>Formalised records and traceable fees improve capture, reduce leakage, and support better long-term planning.</p></text>

